# Citation metadata for the AnySolv code.
#
# NOTE: the trained model weights (model_moe.pt) are NOT in this repository.
# They are released separately on Hugging Face under the FAIR Chemistry License — a
# derivative of Meta's UMA (uma-s-1p2), not MIT. Please cite the AnySolv paper
# (`preferred-citation`) and the UMA model (listed under `references`) that the weights derive from.
#
